          "text": "Unsteadiness and mobility"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports feeling “bit wobbly on my pins lately” for months, worse over the last few weeks. Trouble getting out of a low chair or bed and needs increased help for showering and transfers. Gait with 4WW and standby assistance is slow, with a wide-ish base and hesitant turns. Needs arms to push up and makes multiple attempts."
